msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Ayako-chan, Ayako-chan! I saw the cutest little dog toy at\r\n"
"the pet store today!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"My old dog used to have a toy just like it, so I'm sure Mame\r\n"
"would love it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Can I borrow some money to get it for him? Pleeease?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"(I wonder how much it costs. I only have a little more than\r\n"
"500 yen of my allowance left...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "How much do you need, Izumi-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Ummm! I think it's 500 yen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"(That's practically all I have left. And there's still a few\r\n"
"more days until I get more allowance...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Pleeeeeease! Mame's gonna love it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "...All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Yay! Thanks, Ayako-chan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Ngh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Ayako-chan..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Shiro? What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "My... My... My teacher's so mean!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Hey, calm down. What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"He thinks I cheated on our math test 'cause I got a perfect score, and "
"wouldn't believe me when I tried telling him the truth!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"He just called me a liar and gave me a bunch of extra homework as "
"punishment... Grammar homework. I don't get it at all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Don't worry, Shiro. I'll help you out in a bit, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Really!? Thanks, Ayako-chan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Ayako."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "...Hi, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Have you taken your bath yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "I was just about to, yeah. I think Haruka-chan's in there now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "She'll be out any second, I'm sure. By the way, Ayako..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Huh? What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"It's just... you spend so much time putting other people's needs before "
"your own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Of course I do. They need me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Oh, I think I hear Haruka-chan getting out of the bath!\r\n"
"I should go jump in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr ""

